WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.375
- First of all, you got to work on your stamina.

00:00:02.375 --> 00:00:06.250
- Chuck, I would destroy you.
Even before you discovered carbs.

00:00:09.583 --> 00:00:12.958
Trust the process. Trust the process. Trust the—

00:00:12.958 --> 00:00:15.375
- [Modern announcer:] Welcome to the 
arena outside of space and time,

00:00:15.375 --> 00:00:17.291
where we play one-on-one, win by two.

00:00:17.583 --> 00:00:21.250
On one side, we have 2021's Joel Embiid.

00:00:21.250 --> 00:00:23.625
- All-in. Ah!

00:00:23.625 --> 00:00:25.625
Man, I had good cards!

00:00:25.625 --> 00:00:29.666
- [Old-school announcer:] Versus 1991 Charles Barkley.
The battle of the tough guys.

00:00:29.666 --> 00:00:33.000
- Say no more. I get it. I watch cartoons.

00:00:35.583 --> 00:00:38.250
- Oh, you look mad as hell. Did I spit on your kid?

00:00:38.250 --> 00:00:40.125
- [Modern announcer:] Embiid clearing out some space!

00:00:40.541 --> 00:00:43.500
Joel scores. It's a pump fake for me, fam.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:46.250
- Phila? What the hell happened to Delphia?

00:00:46.250 --> 00:00:49.500
- Play me. I need to prove to future you that I am better.

00:00:49.500 --> 00:00:52.458
- Man, get off me, soft serve Olajuwon.

00:00:54.541 --> 00:00:56.500
- [Old-school announcer:] Barkley is unmovable.

00:00:57.291 --> 00:00:59.250
- [Modern announcer:] He takes a tough fadeaway.

00:00:59.250 --> 00:01:02.000
- [Old-school announcer:] And Chuck proves that
you can't measure heart in inches.

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:05.208
- Hey Robot Marv Albert, can I put money on this game?

00:01:05.208 --> 00:01:09.500
- [Modern announcer:] Barkley drives...he misses...
gets his own rebound...scores.

00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:12.291
Oh, man, this is like seeing old photos of your dad.

00:01:13.750 --> 00:01:16.250
And The Process processed his ass!

00:01:16.250 --> 00:01:19.125
- Charles, look what white people from the internet taught me.

00:01:19.125 --> 00:01:22.791
- What the hell is the internet? Don't y'all have guards?

00:01:22.791 --> 00:01:24.083
- Not really.

00:01:26.041 --> 00:01:30.333
- My God, this guy's less of a role model than me.
Don't look! Don't look!

00:01:31.416 --> 00:01:33.416
- [Old-school announcer:] Barkley is just relentless right now.

00:01:33.416 --> 00:01:34.291
- 'Scuse me.

00:01:35.791 --> 00:01:37.541
- [Modern announcer:] He slams it home!

00:01:37.541 --> 00:01:38.416
- Too weak.

00:01:38.416 --> 00:01:41.416
- [Old-school announcer:] The Round Mound is light on his feet.
- It's too easy.

00:01:43.500 --> 00:01:47.125
- Now let's see how these two do in Playoff Atmosphere!

00:01:47.791 --> 00:01:50.875
- Ow! Come on, man.
- Ah, my knee!

00:01:50.875 --> 00:01:53.041
- [Old-school announcer:] They don't have what it takes.
Turn it off!

00:01:54.708 --> 00:01:57.458
- [Modern announcer:] And Embiid can beat 
America's Uncle right now.

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:00.333
- No man can back me down.

00:02:00.333 --> 00:02:04.750
- I am not a man; I am a TROLL! Hahahahaha!

00:02:04.750 --> 00:02:07.041
- Oh no, he's starting to play like a big man.

00:02:09.416 --> 00:02:14.791
- [Modern announcer:] And Joel wins! Proving he could beat
at least one-third of the guys in the Capitol One ads.

00:02:18.708 --> 00:02:22.166
- Charles, you taught me how to be a big man. 
Do you remember?

00:02:22.166 --> 00:02:25.416
- Why do you think I've been so hard on you?

00:02:25.416 --> 00:02:27.833
- I love you, Charles Barkley.

00:02:27.833 --> 00:02:31.208
- I love you, Joel Embiid.
- [sobbing]

00:02:37.708 --> 00:02:39.041
- This is so fun.

00:02:39.041 --> 00:02:41.000
I'm definitely subscribing for more.

00:02:41.000 --> 00:02:44.166
- Oh God, we're on the kiss cam.
[Crowd chanting "kiss, kiss"]

00:02:44.166 --> 00:02:47.875
I guess we should just get it over with?

00:02:47.875 --> 00:02:50.833
- I, uh, don't think of you that way?

00:02:50.833 --> 00:02:52.791
- [PA announcer:] OK, next couple!

00:02:52.791 --> 00:02:54.916
- You know, they should do MJ vs. LeBron next.

00:02:54.916 --> 00:02:56.000
- I should have taken my brother.

